    Otherwise, stick to RD_max and r_t curves (simpler and robust).
  • If existing wiring instantiation expects directed edges but your converter provides bidirectional A, proceed (this matches your clarified converter).
    If existing code duplicates edges internally, ensure you do not accidentally double-count (validate E_active=2|E| empirically).

